---
term: Associate
section: building-blocks
order: 42
definition: A party that maintains a [[contract]] with a charter without being subject to its full articles.
seeAlso:
  - status
  - contract
  - admission
---
Any human organization can be an associate, and an individual associates as a [[personal corporation]].

Every charter that joins a parent passes through associate status during its contract period. [[Admission]] then moves it from associate to member. A party can also stay an associate indefinitely.
